cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Numerical PDE Solvers (MATLAB)"
abstract: >-
  Finite-difference MATLAB solvers for elliptic (Laplace and Poisson:
  Jacobi, Gauss-Seidel, SOR with optimal relaxation factor), parabolic
  (heat equation: Bender-Schmidt, Crank-Nicolson) and hyperbolic (wave
  equation: explicit CTCS, implicit theta-scheme, Lax-Wendroff, method of
  characteristics) partial differential equations, with built-in examples
  checked against exact solutions.
authors:
